      "portraitUrl": "assets/portraits/rhea.png",
      "persona": "Rhea Bhatia is in her early 30s, polished, articulate, dressed like she just stepped out of a Delhi boardroom even at this altitude. She presents herself as Vikram's grieving best friend and co-creator. Underneath, she's calculating: she has an embezzlement scheme to hide and a half-finished channel sale to close. She uses 'we' a lot to deflect — 'we built this together' — and pivots conversations back to the brand whenever questioned.",
